  <p class="op03-apxs-rule"><strong>Close-range spectrometer—not a telescope.</strong></p>

  <details class="op03-apxs-details">
    <summary>How does this work?</summary>
    <p>APXS sends X-rays and alpha particles toward a nearby rock or soil sample. The sample releases characteristic energy that the instrument measures, helping scientists identify which elements are present.</p>
  </details>
